   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Inclusive Governance: Empowering Youth Voices &amp; Strengthening Democratic Processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Empowering Youth Voices: The Inclusive Governance Pilot Project is an 18-month initiative aimed at enhancing electoral integrity, youth participation, and civic engagement in Kenya. Aligned with UNDP&#x2019;s global goal of enabling 800 million people to vote, the project addresses ongoing democratic challenges such as political marginalization and weak institutional trust. It focuses on empowering youth and marginalized groups by strengthening legal and policy frameworks, building the capacity of</narrative>
  </description>
